      "text": "h = 8\npiles = [3,6,7,11]",
      "fontSize": 19.920568847656245,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "h = 8\npiles = [3,6,7,11]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RA0CkVsbi6SX2xtRsyjI9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 748.8085327148438,
      "y": 369.1861267089844,
      "width": 433.87969970703125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 466452468,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 271088588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778324248742,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If a pile is less than speed, Koko can spend \nthe full hour on it\nIf pile is larger, Koko can spend many hr to\nfinish it (eg, if pile is 10, and speed is 3, it\ntakes 4 hrs: 3+3+3+1)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If a pile is less than speed, Koko can spend \nthe full hour on it\nIf pile is larger, Koko can spend many hr to\nfinish it (eg, if pile is 10, and speed is 3, it\ntakes 4 hrs: 3+3+3+1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uqZSd0QjbB9-PdspiluCJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240.55762481689453,
      "y": 777.299262944227,
      "width": 597.3595581054688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 958697460,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 81527628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778324578185,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Perform Binary Search\nImagine a line of all Possible spends : [1,2,3,4,5,.....max(piles)]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Perform Binary Search\nImagine a line of all Possible spends : [1,2,3,4,5,.....max(piles)]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dTZYL_9uPY78sla_JZcD9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 241.52438354492188,
      "y": 828.0122146043833,
      "width": 743.2925415039062,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1498106612,
      "version": 1111,
      "versionNonce": 1025693044,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778324582885,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Simple Example:\npiles = [3, 6, 11], h = 8\nIf you pick k=1: Takes 3+6+11 = 20 hours. (Too slow!)\nIf you pick k=11: Takes 1+1+1 = 3 hours. (Very fast, but is there a smaller\nk?)\nIf you pick k=4:\nPile 3: 1 hour\nPile 6: 2 hours (4 + 2)\nPile 11: 3 hours (4 + 4 + 3)\nTotal: 6 hours.\n6 is <= 8, so k=4 works!",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Simple Example:\npiles = [3, 6, 11], h = 8\nIf you pick k=1: Takes 3+6+11 = 20 hours. (Too slow!)\nIf you pick k=11: Takes 1+1+1 = 3 hours. (Very fast, but is there a smaller k?)\nIf you pick k=4:\nPile 3: 1 hour\nPile 6: 2 hours (4 + 2)\nPile 11: 3 hours (4 + 4 + 3)\nTotal: 6 hours.\n6 is <= 8, so k=4 works!",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
